    "articles": [
      {
        "sequence_id": 1,
        "text": "C. PREPOSITIONS WITH THE GENITIVE\nNumerous examples of prepositions with dative and/or accusative objects have occurred and have been discussed. In this unit we encounter the first example of a preposition followed by a genitive form:\nDazu haben wir nachher während des Konzerts die beste Gelegenheit.\nThe preposition *während* is one of a very small group of prepositions which are customarily followed by a genitive object. We will note the others as they occur."
      }
